 "nct_id": "NCT04873934",
 "brief_title": "Management of LDL-cholesterol With Inclisiran + Usual Care Compared to Usual Care Alone in Participants With a Recent Acute Coronary Syndrome",
 "official_title": "A Randomized, Controlled, Multicenter, Open-label Trial Comparing a Hospital Post-discharge Care Pathway Involving Aggressive LDL-C Management That Includes Inclisiran With Usual Care Versus Usual Care Alone in Patients With a Recent Acute Coronary Syndrome (VICTORION-INCEPTION)",
